    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βου-πόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ox-piercing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.
			ὀβελός</span> a spit <i>large enough for a whole ox</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.135
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				302
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφώβολοι σφαγῆς . .
			βουπόροι</span> spits <i>fit to pierce an ox's</i> throat,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὀβελίσκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.8.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
